  "note": "Walk scenario (c). Root grants Alice `*` for ten years with the right to issue; Alice narrows to one Kind and a shorter term for Bob; Bob then succeeds himself to a new key and acts with it. The act resolves to Root through two links and one succession edge — authority narrowed monotonically on all three axes, and survived a key change without anybody re-issuing anything.\n\nThe `resolvedAuthority` fixture is the whole derivation, deep-equal: what the record carries is the chain, not the verdict.",
